{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20540","headline":"和裴司空酬满城杨少尹 · 张籍","name":"和裴司空酬满城杨少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣朝偏重大司空，人咏元和第一功。\n拥节高临汉水上，题诗远入舜城中。\n共惊向老多年别，更忆登科旧日同。\n谁不望归丞相府，江边杨柳又秋风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}